 {
  "kind": "text",
  "text": "The SUMMER SALE -40% post is built on the Main comp (1080×1080, 5s). I checked it in preview frames and a screenshot at 3.5s, but I haven't exported a video.\n\n- **Look:** acid yellow background, with cobalt, hot pink and white flat fills. Everything has an 8px black outline and a black copy offset 12px down-right as its hard shadow. Every piece is tilted a few degrees.\n- **Layers:** each element is a group, with its shadow, face and text inside it.\n  - **Card:** the big cobalt card with \"SUMMER\" in yellow.\n  - **SaleBar:** the white \"SALE\" slab.\n  - **EndsSticker:** the pink \"ENDS SUNDAY\" pill. It wasn't in your brief; I added it, along with the next one.\n  - **ShipSticker:** the cobalt \"FREE SHIPPING\" sticker.\n  - **Starburst:** the pink starburst with \"-40%\".\n- **Timing:** the stickers slap on one after another, each scaling up from 0 with an overshoot while its rotation snaps to its final tilt. The starburst is last, at 2.3–2.9s, spinning almost a full turn as it lands. After 3.2s it pulses gently.\n- **Last tweak:** I shrank the \"-40%\" text so it fits inside the starburst. I didn't re-check the frame after that change; the screenshot above was taken just after it, so it may not show it.\n\nI can make the slaps snappier, add a hard camera-shake hit when the burst lands, or add a yellow-to-pink background flash.",
